# Cargo package: the sum is of Buildroot's vendored, re-packed archive
# (see bmcd.hash for the toolchain trap this shares).
#
# The version is commit 01b57ae on excavador-turing/tpi, released as v1.2.2:
# the first release of this tool ever run against a board. 1.2.0 shipped
# with every fork command broken -- the response unwrapper returned the
# wrapper array, and serde read it as the struct's fields in order -- and
# 1.2.1 is the five fixes that followed from actually pointing it at one.
#
# Measured with rust-bin 1.98.1 in the pinned container: `make tpi-source`
# reported got 08400d87 against a blank expectation, then re-run to confirm.
